Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,PatchProof: maintenance patches with reviewable evidence.\NLive public app: patchproof.andrewmohawk.xyz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting a real repair on a curated maintenance task.\NNVIDIA Nemotron Nano on Nebius Token Factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting trimmed. The model-generated candidate enters independent checks.\NEvery declared check runs twice in fresh local Docker containers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Reported run elapsed: 73.933 seconds. Checking wait omitted.\NNow reviewing preserved evidence for that same run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Three approaches, the same frozen task and resource limits.\NAll passed in this development example.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,PatchProof: one model call, one candidate, nine checks passed twice.\NCoverage links each declared requirement to its evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspect the proposed diff against the frozen original snapshot.\NThe patch remains a human review decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Expanded checks show expected values, actual results,\Nand whether repeated observations agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.32,0:01:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier baseline attempt: unchanged code failed four checks.\NIts second candidate passed. Both attempts remain visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.71,0:01:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This PatchProof run: estimated inference cost $0.00010692.\NInvoice charges and container CPU usage remain unmeasured.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.53,0:01:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Download the patch and replayable evidence.\NOpen patchproof.andrewmohawk.xyz to run or review a task.
